{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52040","headline":"山中独坐自赠 · 王绩","name":"山中独坐自赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽人似不平，独坐北山楹。\n携妻梁处士，别妇许先生。\n摈俗劳长叹，寻山倦远行。\n空山斜照落，古树寒烟生。\n解组陶元亮，辞家向子平。\n是非何处在？潭泊苦纵横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}